    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/52c8381515866371b840a9d3e765965f.avif?t=1755110509\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has fallen. Its name has been erased. The truth has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover it, you must enter the Ravensburg Imperial Court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden halls. Glittering chandeliers. Dangerously handsome princes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beauty is a mask. Behind it lurk deadly secrets, ruthless factions, and whispered betrayals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past holds a secret that could change the empire\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find love, or be destroyed by the history you seek to rewrite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo available</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the common route and a preview of the game\u2019s tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art, animations, and story are still in development and will be polished for the full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/4fd3d96fdec373da61b4926454704488.avif?t=1755110509\" width=768 height=1097 /></span><strong>Maximilian,\u00a0The Crimson Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feared, respected, unstoppable. A brilliant strategist and warrior, known by all but truly understood by none. Beneath the armor lies quiet strength.\u00a0 Can you be the one to unlock his heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/c65a323a6ebed46669f05d69c5aa6db8.avif?t=1755110509\" width=768 height=1097 /></span><strong>Lucian,\u00a0The Enigmatic Enchanter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful and charming. He is always one step ahead. His smile draws you in, but you can never quite figure out what he's thinking. Can you resist a man who is impossible to ignore?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/5e0355ad379dda475ba55663117f0314.avif?t=1755110509\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Heroine</strong>:\u00a0Name your heroine and forge your own path through the empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Unique Routes</strong>: Completely different love stories with distinct personalities and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8+ Endings</strong>: Your choices determine everything: love, betrayal, triumph, and tragedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy Scenes</strong>: Get ready for steamy moments with the princes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated Spirits &amp; CGs</strong>: Animated sprites and stunning CGs breathe life into every scene.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/52c8381515866371b840a9d3e765965f.avif?t=1755110509\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family has fallen. Its name has been erased. The truth has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover it, you must enter the Ravensburg Imperial Court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden halls. Glittering chandeliers. Dangerously handsome princes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beauty is a mask. Behind it lurk deadly secrets, ruthless factions, and whispered betrayals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past holds a secret that could change the empire\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find love, or be destroyed by the history you seek to rewrite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo available</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the common route and a preview of the game\u2019s tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art, animations, and story are still in development and will be polished for the full release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/4fd3d96fdec373da61b4926454704488.avif?t=1755110509\" width=768 height=1097 /></span><strong>Maximilian,\u00a0The Crimson Reaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feared, respected, unstoppable. A brilliant strategist and warrior, known by all but truly understood by none. Beneath the armor lies quiet strength.\u00a0 Can you be the one to unlock his heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/c65a323a6ebed46669f05d69c5aa6db8.avif?t=1755110509\" width=768 height=1097 /></span><strong>Lucian,\u00a0The Enigmatic Enchanter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful and charming. He is always one step ahead. His smile draws you in, but you can never quite figure out what he's thinking. Can you resist a man who is impossible to ignore?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/5e0355ad379dda475ba55663117f0314.avif?t=1755110509\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Heroine</strong>:\u00a0Name your heroine and forge your own path through the empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Unique Routes</strong>: Completely different love stories with distinct personalities and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8+ Endings</strong>: Your choices determine everything: love, betrayal, triumph, and tragedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy Scenes</strong>: Get ready for steamy moments with the princes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated Spirits &amp; CGs</strong>: Animated sprites and stunning CGs breathe life into every scene.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Are you looking for steamy romance and enigmatic princes? Step into Fate's Masquerade, where danger and desire collide. Uncover secrets, navigate a court full of intrigue, and make choices that will shape your destiny. Will you find love, or will you be consumed by the empire\u2019s shadows?",
